{"id":114,"flavor":[{"games":["Legends: Arceus"],"text":"It is cloaked entirely in blue vines, preventing any glimpse of its true identity. The vines impart a refreshing sensation when chewed—they're useful as a spice."},{"games":["Shield"],"text":"The vines of a Tangela have a distinct scent. In some parts of Galar, Tangela vines are used as herbs."},{"games":["Sword"],"text":"Hidden beneath a tangle of vines that grows nonstop even if the vines are torn off, this Pokémon’s true appearance remains a mystery."},{"games":["Let’s Go, Eevee!","Let’s Go, Pikachu!","Yellow"],"text":"Its identity is obscured by masses of thick blue vines. The vines are said to never stop growing."},{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Omega Ruby","Sapphire","Ruby"],"text":"Tangela’s vines snap off easily if they are grabbed. This happens without pain, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by newly grown vines the very next day."},{"games":["Y","SoulSilver","Silver"],"text":"It tangles any moving thing with its vines. Their subtle shaking is ticklish if you get ensnared."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2"],"text":"Many writhing vines cover it, so its true identity remains unknown. The blue vines grow its whole life long."},{"games":["White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"The blue vines shrouding its body are covered in a growth of fine hair. It is known to be ticklish."},{"games":["HeartGold","Gold"],"text":"The vines that cloak its entire body are always jiggling. They effectively unnerve its foes."},{"games":["Pearl","Diamond"],"text":"It is shrouded by blue vines. No one has seen the face hidden behind this growth of vines."},{"games":["LeafGreen"],"text":"The whole body is swathed with wide vines that are similar to seaweed. The vines sway as it walks."},{"games":["FireRed"],"text":"Blue plant vines cloak the POKéMON’s identity in a tangled mass. It entangles anything that gets close."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"Its vines snap off easily and painlessly if they are grabbed, allowing it to make a quick getaway. The lost vines are replaced by new growth the very next day."},{"games":["Crystal"],"text":"During battle, it constantly moves the vines that cover its body in order to annoy its opponent."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Chlorophyll","hidden":false,"description":"Boosts the Pokémon's Speed stat in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Leaf Guard","hidden":false,"description":"Prevents status conditions in harsh sunlight."},{"name":"Regenerator","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon has a little of its HP restored when withdrawn from battle."}],"eggGroups":["Grass"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"grassland","color":"Blue","shape":"Legs","evolution":{"id":114,"name":"Tangela","condition":null,"children":[{"id":465,"name":"Tangrowth","condition":"Level up, knowing Ancient Power","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Sword / Shield","level":[[1,20],[1,71],[4,78],[8,74],[12,72],[16,22],[20,77],[24,246],[28,282],[32,202],[36,79],[40,21],[44,321],[48,438],[52,275],[56,580]],"machine":[133,213,34,331,203,412,263,202,416,447,580,63,437,384,438,182,115,156,496,402,214,188,173,76,164,241,14,168],"egg":[93,283,175,73,267,476],"tutor":[803]},"cards":[{"id":"me2pt5-218","name":"Erika's Tangela","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Illustration Rare","number":"218","artist":"buchi","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-218/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-218/large"},{"id":"me2pt5-7","name":"Erika's Tangela","set":"Ascended Heroes","date":"2026-01-30","rarity":"Common","number":"7","artist":"GIDORA","small":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-7/small","large":"https://images.scrydex.com/pokemon/me2pt5-7/large"},{"id":"me1-6","name":"Tangela","set":"Mega Evolution","date":"2025-09-26","rarity":"Common","number":"6","artist":null,"img":"me1/6"},{"id":"sv6-1","name":"Tangela","set":"Twilight Masquerade","date":"2024-05-24","rarity":"Common","num